  const title = plot.closest('.rounded-lg')?.querySelector('h2')?.textContent.trim() || 'Chart';
  wrapper.setAttribute('aria-label', title + ' chart data');
"Nothing else changes" — confirmed, no other hunks.

Method: cp -a the worktree to scratch, ran the branch server on :8141 via
`scripts/whatif-verify.sh start 8141` (isolated data/backups copy). Made a
second scratch copy, `git checkout master -- web` in that copy only, ran it
on :8151 the same way. Both stopped cleanly at the end
(`whatif-verify.sh stop 8141` / `stop 8151` — "stopped and cleaned"). Never
touched :8080/:8081. Playwright at the given path/executablePath/args;
axe.min.js loaded via addScriptTag from the given scratch path (no network
fetch); waited on `#chart-major-expense?.data?.length`; dark via
`classList.toggle('dark', true)` + 400ms; opened every `<details>` before
each axe run.

