  curl -s :8141/dashboard | grep -c 'View chart data'            → 0
  curl -s :8151/dashboard | grep -c 'data-dashboard-chart-table' → 0
  curl -s :8151/dashboard | grep -c 'View chart data'            → 0
  chart-container placeholder markup (data-chart-url attrs) is byte-identical
  between branch and master raw HTML for all five charts (diffed the two
  responses; the only differences are RF1/RF2 territory — font-size classes,
  the new #dashboard-lead paragraph, tile text sizes — none touch the chart
  containers or their placeholders).
This is exactly master's behavior: the data table is a JS-only progressive
enhancement with no server-rendered fallback, unchanged by RF4.

